# Imports & boundaries

- Routes may import `src/common` and `src/types`
- `src/common` must not import `src/routes/*`
- Prefer shared utilities over copy-paste across routes
- Declare runtime dependencies in the package that uses them (root and/or route)
- See `AGENTS.md`
